<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>VECTOR 2.0 by HOODIExSZN</Major>
    <Description>THIS VECTOR SCRIPT IS AT LEAST 80% MORE ACCURATE THEN THE OLD ONE!

INSTRUCTIONS
Just Bind to the left mouse key, and make sure operation mode is on "HOLD UNTIL RELEASED".

DISCLAIMER!
macro will not work if keyran drivers are not installed

Pretty EZ to use, just bind it to the left mouse button.

ATTACHMENTS
Sight- Magnified B
Barrel-Extended Barrel

GAME SETTINGS
Resolution-1920x1080
FOV-84
SenseHorizontal-13
SenseVertical-13
DPI-800

Made by HOODIExSZN

ENJOY!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 1 6
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 5 ms
MoveR -1 6
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 0 6
Delay 5 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 5 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>